{"s":91,"v":[{"t":"By the sun and its brightness","w":[["وَٱلشَّمْسِ","By the sun","wal-shamsi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["شَّمْسِ",354]]],["وَضُحَىٰهَا","and its brightness","waḍuḥāhā","",[["وَ",1],["ضُحَىٰ",1180],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"And [by] the moon when it follows it","w":[["وَٱلْقَمَرِ","And the moon","wal-qamari","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["قَمَرِ",410]]],["إِذَا","when","idhā",""],["تَلَىٰهَا","it follows it","talāhā","",[["تَلَىٰ",203],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"And [by] the day when it displays it","w":[["وَٱلنَّهَارِ","And the day","wal-nahāri","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["نَّهَارِ",219]]],["إِذَا","when","idhā",""],["جَلَّىٰهَا","it displays it","jallāhā","",[["جَلَّىٰ",2292],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"And [by] the night when it covers [i.e., conceals] it","w":[["وَٱلَّيْلِ","And the night","wa-al-layli","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلَّ",2],["يْلِ",150]]],["إِذَا","when","idhā",""],["يَغْشَىٰهَا","it covers it","yaghshāhā","",[["يَغْشَىٰ",688],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"And [by] the sky and He who constructed it","w":[["وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","And the heaven","wal-samāi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["سَّمَآءِ",49]]],["وَمَا","and (He) Who","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["بَنَىٰهَا","constructed it","banāhā","",[["بَنَىٰ",759],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"And [by] the earth and He who spread it","w":[["وَٱلْأَرْضِ","And the earth","wal-arḍi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["وَمَا","and by (He) Who","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["طَحَىٰهَا","spread it","ṭaḥāhā","",[["طَحَىٰ",3813],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"And [by] the soul and He who proportioned it","w":[["وَنَفْسٍۢ","And (the) soul","wanafsin","",[["وَ",1],["نَفْسٍۢ",51]]],["وَمَا","and (He) Who","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["سَوَّىٰهَا","proportioned it","sawwāhā","",[["سَوَّىٰ",682],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"And inspired it [with discernment of] its wickedness and its righteousness,","w":[["فَأَلْهَمَهَا","And He inspired it","fa-alhamahā","",[["فَ",7],["أَلْهَمَ",2929],["هَا",22]]],["فُجُورَهَا","(to distinguish) its wickedness","fujūrahā","",[["فُجُورَ",3980],["هَا",22]]],["وَتَقْوَىٰهَا","and its righteousness","wataqwāhā","",[["وَ",1],["تَقْوَىٰ",567],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"He has succeeded who purifies it,","w":[["قَدْ","Indeed","qad",""],["أَفْلَحَ","he succeeds","aflaḥa",""],["مَن","who","man",""],["زَكَّىٰهَا","purifies it","zakkāhā","",[["زَكَّىٰ",725],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"And he has failed who instills it [with corruption].","w":[["وَقَدْ","And indeed","waqad","",[["وَ",1],["قَدْ",37]]],["خَابَ","he fails","khāba",""],["مَن","who","man",""],["دَسَّىٰهَا","buries it","dassāhā","",[["دَسَّىٰ",3479],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"Thamūd denied [their prophet] by reason of their transgression,","w":[["كَذَّبَتْ","Denied","kadhabat",""],["ثَمُودُ","Thamud","thamūdu",""],["بِطَغْوَىٰهَآ","by their transgression","biṭaghwāhā","",[["بِ",10],["طَغْوَىٰ",3817],["هَآ",22]]]]},{"t":"When the most wretched of them was sent forth.","w":[["إِذِ","When","idhi",""],["ٱنۢبَعَثَ","(was) sent forth","inbaʿatha",""],["أَشْقَىٰهَا","(the) most wicked of them","ashqāhā","",[["أَشْقَىٰ",1707],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"And the messenger of Allāh [i.e., Ṣāliḥ] said to them, \"[Do not harm] the she-camel of Allāh or [prevent her from] her drink.\"","w":[["فَقَالَ","But said","faqāla","",[["فَ",7],["قَالَ",16]]],["لَهُمْ","to them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["رَسُولُ","(the) Messenger","rasūlu",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["نَاقَةَ","(It is the) she-camel","nāqata",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["وَسُقْيَـٰهَا","and her drink","wasuq'yāhā","",[["وَ",1],["سُقْيَ",3672],["ـٰهَا",22]]]]},{"t":"But they denied him and hamstrung her. So their Lord brought down upon them destruction for their sin and made it equal [upon all of them].","w":[["فَكَذَّبُوهُ","But they denied him","fakadhabūhu","",[["فَ",7],["كَذَّبُ",80],["و",3],["هُ",5]]],["فَعَقَرُوهَا","and they hamstrung her","faʿaqarūhā","",[["فَ",7],["عَقَرُ",1369],["و",3],["هَا",22]]],["فَدَمْدَمَ","So destroyed","fadamdama","",[["فَ",7],["دَمْدَمَ",3486]]],["عَلَيْهِمْ","them","ʿalayhim","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِمْ",3]]],["رَبُّهُم","their Lord","rabbuhum","",[["رَبُّ",24],["هُم",3]]],["بِذَنۢبِهِمْ","for their sin","bidhanbihim","",[["بِ",10],["ذَنۢبِ",326],["هِمْ",3]]],["فَسَوَّىٰهَا","and leveled them","fasawwāhā","",[["فَ",7],["سَوَّىٰ",682],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"And He does not fear the consequence thereof.","w":[["وَلَا","And not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["يَخَافُ","He fears","yakhāfu",""],["عُقْبَـٰهَا","its consequences","ʿuq'bāhā","",[["عُقْبَ",1192],["ـٰهَا",22]]]]}]}